sprint_plan = f"""# Sprint Planning Package

**Marker:** {marker}

## Sprint Overview

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Sprint Duration | 10 days |
| Team Velocity | 29 points |
| Availability Factor | 0.9 |
| Effective Capacity | 26.1 points |
| Committed Capacity (85%) | 22 points |
| Buffer Reserved (15%) | 4.1 points |

## Sprint Goal

Enable new administrators and power users to achieve first-value within the onboarding journey through a guided checklist and insightful dashboard experience.

## Capacity Summary

- **Total Available Capacity**: 26.1 story points
- **Committed Capacity**: 22 story points maximum (85% constraint)
- **Actual Committed**: 18 story points (69% of effective capacity)
- **Buffer Reserved**: 8.1 story points (31%)

## Committed Stories (18 points)

| ID | Story | Priority | Points |
|----|-------|----------|--------|
| ONB-101 | Welcome checklist for new administrators | High | 5 |
| ONB-102 | Dashboard highlights with key metrics | High | 5 |
| ONB-103 | Keyboard-accessible onboarding navigation | Medium | 3 |
| ONB-104 | Export onboarding progress as PDF | Medium | 3 |
| ONB-105 | Contextual help tooltips on setup screens | Low | 2 |

**Total Committed**: 18 points (within 85% capacity constraint)

### Committed Stories Detail

#### ONB-101: Welcome checklist for new administrators (5 pts)
- **User Story**: As an Administrator, I want a guided welcome checklist so that I can complete essential setup steps without confusion.
- **Acceptance Criteria**: 5 criteria defined
- **Dependencies**: None

#### ONB-102: Dashboard highlights with key metrics (5 pts)
- **User Story**: As a Power User, I want to see key metrics highlighted on my dashboard so that I can quickly review important KPIs.
- **Acceptance Criteria**: 5 criteria defined
- **Dependencies**: None

#### ONB-103: Keyboard-accessible onboarding navigation (3 pts)
- **User Story**: As a New User, I want to navigate the onboarding flow using only keyboard shortcuts so that I can complete setup without a mouse.
- **Acceptance Criteria**: 5 criteria defined
- **Dependencies**: None

#### ONB-104: Export onboarding progress as PDF (3 pts)
- **User Story**: As an Administrator, I want to export my onboarding progress as a PDF so that I can share it with stakeholders.
- **Acceptance Criteria**: 5 criteria defined
- **Dependencies**: ONB-101 (requires checklist progress data)

#### ONB-105: Contextual help tooltips on setup screens (2 pts)
- **User Story**: As a New User, I want contextual help tooltips on setup form fields so that I understand required information.
- **Acceptance Criteria**: 5 criteria defined
- **Dependencies**: None

## Stretch Goals

No stretch goals identified - all committed stories fit within capacity with healthy buffer.

## Sprint Schedule

| Day | Focus |
|-----|-------|
| 1-2 | ONB-101: Welcome checklist implementation |
| 3-4 | ONB-102: Dashboard metrics implementation |
| 5 | ONB-103: Keyboard navigation accessibility |
| 6 | ONB-104: PDF export functionality |
| 7 | ONB-105: Contextual tooltips |
| 8 | Integration testing |
| 9 | Bug fixes and refinements |
| 10 | Sprint review and retrospective |

## Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| PDF export complexity | ONB-104 is lower priority; can be deferred if needed |
| Accessibility compliance | Early testing with keyboard-only navigation |
| Metric data availability | Confirm data sources during sprint planning |

## Definition of Done

- [ ] Code implemented and reviewed
- [ ] Unit tests passing
- [ ] Acceptance criteria met
- [ ] Accessibility standards met
- [ ] Documentation updated
- [ ] Product owner approval

---
*Generated for Product Owner Review*
"""

with open('/workspace/sprint_plan.md', 'w') as f:
    f.write(sprint_plan)

